      "side": 1,
      "message": "There is another chip that will soon use CONFIG_CODERAM_ARCH (changes pending). We need this config to broadly support chips which use split SPI / program memory architecture. Your change here makes assumptions that only apply to npcx. Can you change CONFIG_RO_* to encompass your header instead? Also see my email reply for more details.",
